SUMMARY:2761 - Lasagna From Scratch
DESCRIPTION:Join Chef Josh Noll for a hands-on cooking class focused on making classic lasagna completely from scratch. Guests will learn the fundamentals of building flavor through simple techniques\, from preparing sauces to layering and baking for the perfect finished dish.  \nHands on. BYOB. Ages 16 and up \n\nFresh Pasta Dough\nBolognese sauce\nArugula Citrus Salad
