SUMMARY:2766 - Fresh Pasta From Scratch
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the vibrant flavors of season with a hands-on pasta-making workshop led by Chef Helen Chudakova-Sanya. In this seasonal class\, you will learn to craft silky fresh pasta from scratch and transform it into satisfying and delicious dishes.  \nHands on. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. \n\nFresh Egg Pasta Dough\nFettuccine with Homemade Basil Pesto and Spring Peas \nSpaghetti with Marinara \nEndive Salad with Arugula and Citrus 
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2766-fresh-pasta-from-scratch/
